# Provenance and licensing notice

This repository is an independent, MIT-licensed implementation of a host-side
driver for the FocalTech FT8719 touch controller.

## Vendor driver

The wire behaviour in `FtsProtocol.c` was derived by reading the Linux driver at

    Dracen-W/android_kernel_xiaomi_mt6768_S
    branch Lineage-24.0-merlin-4.19-r49p1-features-stable
    drivers/input/touchscreen/mediatek/FT8719P

That driver is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2. It was
used only as a source of observable protocol facts: package bytes, register
numbers, command sequences, timing constants, the CRC polynomial and initial
value, the touch record layout, and the firmware download sequence. No source
code, comment, table or data file from that driver is copied into this
repository, and this repository is not a derivative work of it. The
implementation here is written from those facts and is released under the MIT
license in `LICENSE`.

The GPL-2.0 vendor driver is not vendored here. Do not copy code from it into
this tree.

## Structural reference

The repository layout and the staged bring-up approach follow
`UniXNU/ShengNovatekTouch`, which is licensed under
BSD-2-Clause-Patent. Only the structure and the idea of a portable protocol
layer, a pure touch core, and a default-off XNU probe were used. No code from
that project is copied here, and none of its hard-coded Novatek ABI is reused.

## Firmware

No vendor firmware image is included, linked, generated or embedded by this
repository. `FtsProbe.cpp` and `FtsProtocol.c` support an optional image that
the board repository may supply through the weak `fts_board_firmware` and
`fts_board_firmware_size` symbols. That image remains the property of its
owner and is subject to its own distribution terms.

